{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Welcome to Battle Island</strong>:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build Fast. Fight Together. Survive the Night.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">YAARRGH! Battle Island is a high-pressure co-op survival roguelite where escalating skeleton invasions tear through your island defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scavenge by day. Fortify your base. Unlock devastating weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When the sun sets, they come in waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And they don\u2019t stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is not a slow survival sandbox.<br>This is escalating siege survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/8bccbef33b0290cb9f31a7245d725e23.poster.avif?t=1771389313\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/8bccbef33b0290cb9f31a7245d725e23.webm?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/8bccbef33b0290cb9f31a7245d725e23.mp4?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Lootin\u2019, shootin\u2019, stealin\u2019, blastin\u2019, buildin\u2019, diggin\u2019, what more could a pirate want!?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build by Day. Survive the Skeleton Siege by Night.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/a5be69afb2bb1d13e0c0c503fe6ab1a4.poster.avif?t=1771389313\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/a5be69afb2bb1d13e0c0c503fe6ab1a4.webm?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/a5be69afb2bb1d13e0c0c503fe6ab1a4.mp4?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2694\ufe0f The Core Loop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every run is a race against time:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 Scavenge and mine during daylight<br>\u2022 Build and reinforce your island defenses<br>\u2022 Unlock powerful weapons and upgrades<br>\u2022 Survive relentless night assaults<br>\u2022 Adapt as enemies evolve and pressure increases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Survive longer. Grow stronger.<br>Then hold the line as the difficulty spikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u201cThis is not a slow survival sandbox; this is escalating siege pressure.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/99d958118bccc60031606245417f05cf.poster.avif?t=1771389313\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/99d958118bccc60031606245417f05cf.webm?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/99d958118bccc60031606245417f05cf.mp4?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfae Wishlist Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you enjoy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 High-pressure co-op survival<br>\u2022 Base-building under siege<br>\u2022 Wave defense with escalating tension<br>\u2022 Replayable roguelite progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Add YAARRGH! Battle Island to your Wishlist and be ready when Early Access launches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/ba0097193c233280b97ec9d69faf5121.avif?t=1771389313\" width=1200 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Procedurally Generated Battle Islands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every run drops you onto a new pirate island with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 Unique terrain layouts<br>\u2022 Shifting danger zones<br>\u2022 Randomized enemy compositions<br>\u2022 Escalating night modifiers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No two runs play the same.<br>The island adapts the longer you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/94df6f81314afbd9ae71e2b8ebcfdaab.poster.avif?t=1771389313\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/94df6f81314afbd9ae71e2b8ebcfdaab.webm?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/94df6f81314afbd9ae71e2b8ebcfdaab.mp4?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc80 Escalating Skeleton Siege</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The horde grows more dangerous every night:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 New enemy types<br>\u2022 Increased spawn density<br>\u2022 Stronger siege units<br>\u2022 Boss-level invasions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your base is never safe for long.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\uddf1 Mine. Build. Defend.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Preparation is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MINE</strong> rare ores and treasure.<br><strong>BUILD</strong> walls, towers, bunkers, and fortresses.<br><strong>CRAFT</strong> weapons, armour, traps, and siege counters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every structure matters.</strong><br><br><strong>If your base falls, so do you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/ab67084d7c5d765c117728d9a463b88e.poster.avif?t=1771389313\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/ab67084d7c5d765c117728d9a463b88e.webm?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/ab67084d7c5d765c117728d9a463b88e.mp4?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udcb0 Loot, Upgrades &amp; Power Spikes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defeat enemies and explore the island to earn treasure and powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 Stack abilities for explosive synergies<br>\u2022 Push your pirate into unstoppable territory<br>\u2022 Feel the power spike \u2014 then fight to keep up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The island gives.</strong><br><br><strong>Then it takes.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f Designed for Co-op Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play solo or team up with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Coordinate builds.<br>Share resources.<br>Cover each other when the walls crack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Victory requires teamwork.</strong><br><br><strong>Panic guarantees defeat.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd01 Roguelite Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every run evolves differently:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 Procedural wave modifiers<br>\u2022 Randomized upgrade paths<br>\u2022 Unlockable abilities<br>\u2022 Permanent progression systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Master the system.</strong><br><br><strong>Optimize your builds.</strong><br><br><strong>Push further every time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/0c15307ac5d781b059010a2c09aec2be.poster.avif?t=1771389313\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/0c15307ac5d781b059010a2c09aec2be.webm?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/0c15307ac5d781b059010a2c09aec2be.mp4?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2693 Join the Crew</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">YAARRGH! Battle Island is in active development, shaped directly by community playtests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Request PlayTest access. Survive the island. Help shape what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Limited playtest slots available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/0c6ecd26a33610bf6a5d76581fbe304b.avif?t=1771389313\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u201cFaster than traditional survival games. More tactical than standard wave defense.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1612750?t=1771389313","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/110c50be2886be03e7dadf1dd1bf3a8c9b89458b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771389313","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/d56370e4fd00747413a8532646e05d3a642c9fd9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771389313","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/d56370e4fd00747413a8532646e05d3a642c9fd9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771389313","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboa