kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/94df6f81314afbd9ae71e2b8ebcfdaab.mp4?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc80 Escalating Skeleton Siege</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The horde grows more dangerous every night:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 New enemy types<br>\u2022 Increased spawn density<br>\u2022 Stronger siege units<br>\u2022 Boss-level invasions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your base is never safe for long.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\uddf1 Mine. Build. Defend.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Preparation is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MINE</strong> rare ores and treasure.<br><strong>BUILD</strong> walls, towers, bunkers, and fortresses.<br><strong>CRAFT</strong> weapons, armour, traps, and siege counters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every structure matters.</strong><br><br><strong>If your base falls, so do you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/ab67084d7c5d765c117728d9a463b88e.poster.avif?t=1771389313\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/ab67084d7c5d765c117728d9a463b88e.webm?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/ab67084d7c5d765c117728d9a463b88e.mp4?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udcb0 Loot, Upgrades &amp; Power Spikes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defeat enemies and explore the island to earn treasure and powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 Stack abilities for explosive synergies<br>\u2022 Push your pirate into unstoppable territory<br>\u2022 Feel the power spike \u2014 then fight to keep up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The island gives.</strong><br><br><strong>Then it takes.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f Designed for Co-op Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play solo or team up with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Coordinate builds.<br>Share resources.<br>Cover each other when the walls crack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Victory requires teamwork.</strong><br><br><strong>Panic guarantees defeat.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd01 Roguelite Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every run evolves differently:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 Procedural wave modifiers<br>\u2022 Randomized upgrade paths<br>\u2022 Unlockable abilities<br>\u2022 Permanent progression systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Master the system.</strong><br><br><strong>Optimize your builds.</strong><br><br><strong>Push further every time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/0c15307ac5d781b059010a2c09aec2be.poster.avif?t=1771389313\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/0c15307ac5d781b059010a2c09aec2be.webm?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/0c15307ac5d781b059010a2c09aec2be.mp4?t=1771389313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2693 Join the Crew</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">YAARRGH! Battle Island is in active development, shaped directly by community playtests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Request PlayTest access. Survive the island. Help shape what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Limited playtest slots available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/0c6ecd26a33610bf6a5d76581fbe304b.avif?t=1771389313\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u201cFaster than traditional survival games. More tactical than standard wave defense.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["GreedyVox"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/736301da16b878fdcfe4abe8c86108534f077dbd/header.jpg?t=1771389313","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"AI-Generated Content Disclosure<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring the development process, we may use procedural- and AI-based tools to assist with content creation. In all such cases, the final product reflects the creativity and expression of our own development team.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul 